[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6664.629, "timestamp": "01:51:04", "text": "そう思いませんか？はぁ？ジョアバカ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6667.239, "timestamp": "01:51:07", "text": "ジョアバカ。 ジョアバカ。それはブタカのようなものだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6682.47, "timestamp": "01:51:22", "text": "待って、それはカカだ。うん。どうやって転ぶの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6685.7, "timestamp": "01:51:25", "text": "何てことだ。え、これ？いいえ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6687.47, "timestamp": "01:51:27", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6690.669, "timestamp": "01:51:30", "text": "あぁ、やあ。わかった。待って。これ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6694.709, "timestamp": "01:51:34", "text": "方法。こちらです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6697.189, "timestamp": "01:51:37", "text": "ああ、同じことだ。私たちも同じことを"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6698.91, "timestamp": "01:51:38", "text": "した。しかし、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6704.39, "timestamp": "01:51:44", "text": "ところで、ドリンゴが亡くなりました。おい、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6706.149, "timestamp": "01:51:46", "text": "何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6711.91, "timestamp": "01:51:51", "text": "その鳥は死んだ。ああ、完璧だったよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6713.669, "timestamp": "01:51:53", "text": "何？その後、私は何をすべきですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6717.35, "timestamp": "01:51:57", "text": "今これですか？おお。えっと、開けて"}]